Use the distance-and-connectivity heuristic early, then switch to the stronger return-to-start bias as the tour progresses.

```python
def use_heuristics(state):
    if state["availability"]["construction_progress"]:
        progress = state["construction_progress"]
    else:
        progress = 0.5
    if progress < 0.6:
        return 9
    else:
        return 1
